{%- comment -%}
  Cinematic intro. Sits ON TOP of already-painted content — it never gates
  rendering, so LCP is unaffected. Shown once per session, removed by JS,
  and hidden entirely under prefers-reduced-motion or no-JS.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if settings.enable_intro -%}
  <div class="veil" data-veil aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="veil__mark kanji">夜</span>
    <span class="veil__bar"></span>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
